.TH MLOCK 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
mlock \- locks pages containing the specified range in memory, subject to resource limits
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/mman.h>
.B int mlock(const void* address, size_t byte_count);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Locks pages containing the specified range in memory, subject to resource limits.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mlock (2)
